    <Label layout="20.0,1010.0,1480.0,20.0" text="Go-live: add the AirPlug gateway to the BACnet network, discover the AVs and link each proxy point out → in10 of the matching zone point (replaces the simulation ramp), or map the proxies directly with the same names. Alarms, colours and averages then work unchanged." font="8.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#e8edf2" halign="left"/>

